B0FV8F222Y: { name: "LINGHUFOX 86in Dual-System Smart Board", p1: "LINGHUFOX pairs genuine Windows 11 Pro (Intel 13th Gen i5-13450HX, 10 cores, 16 threads, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD) with Android 13 (8GB RAM, 128GB ROM), a substantially more powerful Windows configuration than most dual-OS rivals in this comparison.", p2: "The dual-system design supports professional applications like AutoCAD, Photoshop, Figma, and Illustrator directly, not just basic office apps, and an AI auto-framing camera with 8-array microphone handles conferencing across Zoom, Teams, Meet, and Webex.", specs: ["86in 4K, Windows 11 Pro i5-13450HX + Android 13", "16GB RAM/256GB SSD (Windows side)", "Supports AutoCAD, Photoshop, Figma"], pros: ["Genuinely powerful 13th-gen i5 Windows configuration, not a basic OPS module", "Supports professional creative/CAD software directly", "20-point touch with palm/back-hand erasing"], cons: ["Higher price reflecting the substantial Windows hardware", "Dual-system complexity for buyers who only need one OS"] },
